{"results":[{"url":"https://www.nobrokerage.com/project/details/shreeji-skyrise-kandivali-west-cmj11c2ig029bsahfyv3mqrnb","title":"Shreeji Skyrise, Kandivali West, Mumbai - NoBrokerage.com","raw_content":"![Loading...](/Loader.webp)\n\n* [![Home](/icons/home_quick_link.svg)Home](/)\n* [![Search](/icons/search_quick_link.svg)Search](/search)\n* [![Property](/icons/Add_quick_link.svg)Property](/form/postproperty)\n* [![Profile](/icons/profile_quick_link.svg)Profile](/dashboard)\n\n![Shreeji Skyrise banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765970900741-2a7ea6234bcfdb07.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/15/IMAGE/shreeji-sharan-logo-png-3-5a83b4.png)\n\nFor all good things in life.\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765970900740-4333f56053154b82.png)\n\n## 2 & 3 BHK Homes, Office, Shop\n\nStarting from₹ 2.64 Cr\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Shreeji Skyrise mobile banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765970900731-93a3fd32bb1bdf6d.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/15/IMAGE/shreeji-sharan-logo-png-3-5a83b4.png)\n\nFor all good things in life.\n\n![Project details background](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765970900730-a14e7334e06be87b.jpg)\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765970900740-4333f56053154b82.png)\n\nPresenting\n\n## 2 & 3 BHK Homes, Office, Shop\n\nStarting from₹ 2.64 Cr\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\nLast Updated : 01 Sept, 2026\n\nShreeji Skyrise\n\nBROKERAGE FREE\n\n[By Shreeji Construction](/builder/shreeji-sharan \"Open Shreeji Construction page\")\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 51.84 Lac – 5.66 Cr+ Charges\n\nEMI starts at ₹ 44.99 K / M\n\nUnder Construction\n\nCompletion In 31 Dec 2026 Onwards\n\nShreeji Skyrise, by the SHREEJI SHARAN Group, is strategically located in Kandivali West, offering seamless connectivity just 0.3 km from the railway station. The project focuses on a complete lifestyle, providing a Kids Play Area, Sky Cafe, and Learning Center amenities . it offers thoughtfully planned residential units with RERA Carpet Areas up to 1071 sq. ft.. Its strong location advantage, near malls and healthcare, makes it a desirable, practical, and well- connected investment opportunity in the micro-market.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\n![Project Type](/projectOverview/icons/project-type.svg)\n\n#### Project Type\n\n![Status](/projectOverview/icons/status.svg)\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![Project Area](/projectOverview/icons/project-area.svg)\n\n#### Project Area\n\n5616.01 sq.mt\n\n![Towers](/projectOverview/icons/tower.svg)\n\n#### Towers\n\n1\n\n![Configurations](/projectOverview/icons/configuration.svg)\n\n#### Configurations\n\n2 & 3 BHK Apartments, Office, Shop\n\n![Total Floors](/projectOverview/icons/total-units.svg)\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n50\n\n![Amenities](/projectOverview/icons/amenities.svg)\n\n#### Amenities\n\n20 Amenities\n\n![Parking](/projectOverview/icons/parking.svg)\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\n![Locality](/projectOverview/icons/locality.svg)\n\n#### Locality\n\nKandivali West\n\n![Pin code](/projectOverview/icons/pincode.svg)\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400067\n\n![Landmark](/projectOverview/icons/landmark.svg)\n\n#### Landmark\n\nNear Shree Lakshmi Narayan Mandir\n\n![Address](/projectOverview/icons/address.svg)\n\n#### Address\n\nShreeji Skyrise, Swami Vivekanand Rd, Opp. Fire Station, Kandivali, Parekh Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n## Configurations\n\n2 BHK715.47 - 827.1 sq.ft\n\n₹ 2.71 – 3.13 Crore\n\n3 BHK693.94 - 1484.99 sq.ft\n\n₹ 2.64 – 5.66 Crore\n\nOffice space138.1 - 517.42 sq.ft\n\n₹ 51.84 Lac – 1.94 Crore\n\nShop170.17 - 177.17 sq.ft\n\n₹ 63.86 – 66.49 Lac\n\n![background pattern](/icons/BgPattern.svg)\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\n![schedule illustration](/icons/Illustration.svg)\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n2 BHK₹ 2.71 Cr\n\n715.47 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2.71 Cr\n\n715.47sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 2.71 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n2 BHK₹ 2.96 Cr\n\n780.6 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2.96 Cr\n\n780.6sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 2.96 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n2 BHK₹ 3.07 Cr\n\n810.84 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 3.07 Cr\n\n810.84sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 3.07 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n2 BHK₹ 3.13 Cr\n\n827.1 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 3.13 Cr\n\n827.1sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 3.13 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2026\n\n## AboutProject\n\nCodename SKYRISE, located on S.V. Road opposite the Kandivali Fire Station in Kandivali West, boasts a highly strategic, valuable location. It is perfectly positioned for residents to shop, socialize, and connect effortlessly within the wider city network. The project's exceptional connectivity is a major real estate advantage, with Kandivali Railway Station only 0.3 km away and the vital Western Express Highway (WEH) accessible at 2.8 km. Furthermore, daily conveniences like Dmart, PVR Milaap, and Growels 101 Mall are all well within easy reach. The residential development features thoughtfully planned layouts to ensure superior space utilization and comfort. Residents can look forward to unique amenities that cater to a modern lifestyle, including a dedicated Kids Play Area, a Sky Cafe, and a Learning Center. Unit RERA Carpet Areas are listed at 781 sq. ft. and 1071 sq. ft.. The proximity to educational institutions and healthcare like ACE Heart Hospital is another key benefit. RERA No.: P51800032149.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/kids-swimming-pool.svg)\n\nKids Swimming Pool\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/spa.svg)\n\nSpa\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/swimming-pool-79335b.png)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/club-house-a73a39.png)\n\nClubhouse\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/fitness-center.svg)\n\nFitness Center\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/power-backup.svg)\n\nPower Backup\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/steam-room.svg)\n\nSteam Room\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24-7-water-supply.svg)\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24x7-security.svg)\n\n24x7 Security\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/creche.svg)\n\nCreche\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/children-play-area.svg)\n\nChildren Play Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/reflexology-pathway.svg)\n\nReflexology Pathway\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/business-lounges.svg)\n\nBusiness Lounges\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/unisex-saloon.svg)\n\nUnisex Saloon\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\n![Brochure Page 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmj11c2ig029bsahfyv3mqrnb/v1/page_1_full.webp)\n\n1of8\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nKandivali West offers a well-balanced suburban lifestyle with strong infrastructure, convenient transport links, and diverse housing choices. The area’s proximity to major roads and rail routes enhances accessibility across Mumbai. Reputed schools, hospitals, and shopping hubs add to its livability. Continuous development and metro expansion have strengthened its real estate value, making Kandivali West a dependable choice for homebuyers seeking connectivity, comfort, and community-oriented urban living in the city’s western suburbs.\n\n## Maps\n\nInitializing Map...\n\n![Verified](/icons/green-check.svg)RERA Verified Project\n\n### What is RERA ?\n\nRERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.\n\nIts primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.\n\n![RERA Approved](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png)\n\n![RERA QR Code](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765970900739-70d2df3948f58045.jpg)\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51800032149\n\n## AboutDeveloper\n\n[![Shreeji Sharan Group](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/15/IMAGE/shreeji-sharan-logo-jpg-3-78b5a3.jpg)](/builder/shreeji-sharan \"Shreeji Sharan Group\")\n\nShreeji Sharan Group![Check](/icons/green-check.svg)\n\nYears of Experience –36 years\n\nThe SHREEJI SHARAN Group is the reputable developer behind Shreeji Aikyam, with Design Studio Architects expertly providing the architectural vision for the project. The group's significant credibility in the competitive real estate market is substantiated by its robust portfolio of successful projects, which includes well-known developments like Shreeji Skyrise, Daivi Eterneety, Shreeji Paradise, and others. This consistent history of delivering multiple residential developments strongly indicates an established presence and sustained commitment to the demanding real estate sector. The comprehensive master plan for Shreeji Aikyam itself demonstrates a high degree of careful planning, featuring multiple structures, dedicated amenity zones, and strategically designed 6-meter and 9-meter wide driveways for smooth traffic flow.\n\n17ProjectsCompleted\n\n10OngoingProjects\n\n1In CityProjects\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nNoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.\n\nThe data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.\n\nNo information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n\nFor feedback or concerns, email: [support@nobrokerage.com](mailto:support@nobrokerage.com)\n\nLoading reviews...\n\n# Frequently Asked\n\nQuestions\n\nGet answers to the most common questions about Shreeji Skyrise in West Pune\n\nShreeji Skyrise is developed by Shreeji Construction, a reputed real estate developer in the region.\n\nShreeji Skyrise is conveniently located near major transport hubs, ensuring seamless connectivity for daily travel.\n\nShreeji Skyrise consists of 1 towers with 50 floors each, offering a premium vertical living experience.\n\nThe RERA registration number(s) for Shreeji Skyrise are P51800032149. You can verify these details on the official state RERA portal.\n\nShreeji Skyrise offers Office Space, Shop, 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments, each designed for modern comfortable living.\n\nYes, Shreeji Skyrise offers dedicated parking for residents, ensuring convenience and security for personal vehicles.\n\nShreeji Skyrise is currently Under Construction in the area, the city. The project is progressing as per RERA timelines.\n\nThe expected possession date of Shreeji Skyrise is expected by Dec 2026, as per the RERA filing.\n\nShreeji Skyrise comprises multiple residential units designed to cater to different family sizes and preferences.\n\nThe price of apartments in this project starts at ₹51.84 L per sq.ft, offering great value in the real estate market.\n\nShreeji Skyrise is located at\n\n![sparkle](/sparkle-icon.svg)\n\nNOBO AI\n\nAI Assistant is Online\n\n# Need Help Finding the Right Property?\n\nChat with our AI assistant for instant answers on West Pune properties—pricing, locations, amenities, and availability. Available 24/7 to guide you at every step.\n\n## Are you Interested inShreeji Skyrise?\n\nShreeji Skyrise, Kandivali West, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","images":[]},{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/shreeji-sharan-group/shreeji-skyrise-1184","title":"Shreeji Skyrise, Kandivali West, Mumbai | 2 & 3 BHK Luxury Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"[![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)](/)\n\n[![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)Connect Now](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=918169114718&text=Hi%2C+I%27m+looking+to+Buy+a+residential+property+in+Mumbai.+Please+connect+with+me.+Thanks%21&type=phone_number&app_absent=0)\n\n![Project Image of Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 29008](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/Project%20Image/1184_1678021409_d6a9349381f127e54db0e84de114ac77.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Project Image of Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 29007](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/Project%20Image/1184_1678021409_dd0f0f4d9e2a03f27755a3b547078f23.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 29009](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/Amenities/1184_1678021409_9690fd66bc6860db6f21a14027699f35.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 29010](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/Amenities/1184_1678021409_d920f97d13623213c19a7bd1633f0ab8.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 29011](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/Amenities/1184_1678021409_57d45d3062c0de1122c71b262c109fff.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 29012](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/Amenities/1184_1678021409_24515194bffb498aa26425353d62368a.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Sample Apartment of Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 29013](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/Sample%20Apartment/1184_1678021409_db6aaa6dbbd988ac4f95eed40a69dd4f.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n![Location of Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 29014](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/Location/1184_1678021409_a9ae74dbb20fa7225a76b85428bebaa6.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Luxury\n\n## Project Overview of Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nProject Status\n\nNew Launch\n\nNo. of Units\n\n189 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n1.38 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 51 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nThe Skyrise project by Shreeji Sharan Group of Companies is located in the sought-after location of Kandivali (West). It offers an exclusive experience that will enrich the quality of your life. The property is close to several religious sites, such as Shree Kala Hanuman Temple and Shri Swami Narayan Temple.  \n  \nIt is also close to recreational hubs like the Country Club, MCA Club, and Poisar Gymkhana. It connects to health care systems like the ACE Heart Hospital, Namaha Hospital, KHM Hospital, and reputed schools like Thakur International School, Shri T P Bhatia College, and SVI School & Jr College.  \n  \nThe project boasts amenities such as Elegant Business Lounge, Fully Equipped Fitness Center, Indulging Clubhouse, Beauty Salon, Dance Studio, Simulation Games Room, Dedicated Massage Room, Learning Center, all thoughtfully planned to maximize your living needs and has prioritized comfort of its residents, offering amenities and features that enhance their daily lives.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 456096](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/BHK_Configuration/1184_1678021409_72fd8a5e8035affff4281a68a05e1255.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n715 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.28 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 456097](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/BHK_Configuration/1184_1678021409_c54a664f35400f9b8cc04b9432f41ba1.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n781 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.5 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 456098](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/BHK_Configuration/1184_1678021409_0c788ebb5144f7ffac38ec93eeb0f7a0.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n827 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.64 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 456099](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/BHK_Configuration/1184_1678021409_9acd3ff3e6c73686af22bfd133fbaaf7.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1102 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n3.52 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 29015](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1184/Floor%20Plan/1184_1678021409_81148c291274a4980332182dfb0d2c03.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Well-Equipped Clubhouse.\n* Top-Notch Amenities.\n* Serene Environment.\n* Multipurpose Hall.\n* Health and Fitness Centre.\n* High-Grade Elevators.\n\n## Amenities Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Intercom Facility\n* Lift\n* Security\n* Power Back Up\n* Drivers Room\n* Common Toilets\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* High-Speed Elevators\n* Wi-Fi Enabled\n* Parking and transportation\n* Society Office\n* Medical Room\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Video Door Phone\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* Smart locks\n* 24/7 Security\n* Fireplace\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n* Games Room\n\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Swimming Pool\n* Spa Room\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Theme Wall\n* Therapeutic Healing Path\n* Sunning Lawn\n* Studio Space For Yoga\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Zen Garden\n* Themed Landscape Garden\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n* Green Entrance Lobby\n\n* Wooden flooring\n* Utility flooring with tiles\n* Door with digital lock\n* Modular kitchen\n* Water Purifier\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Aluminium sliding windows\n* Air-conditioned apartments\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Granite tile flooring\n* Gypsum-finished Walls\n* Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n* Gas Leak Detector\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Water Purifier\n* Dado Tiles\n* Inverter\n* Geyser Point\n* Cp Fittings - Jaquar\n\n## Google Map Location of Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Kandivali West](/location-review/mumbai/kandivali-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Kandivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Kandivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nShreeji Skyrise is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800032149](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800032149)\n\nProject: Shreeji Skyrise\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West\n\n---\n\n* Nirmal Junior College\n* Shri T.P. Bhatia College of Science\n* Balbharti College Of Commerce\n* KES Shroff college\n\n* Pooja Enclave/Oscar Hospital\n* Paarth Hospital\n* Phoenix Hospital Pvt Ltd.\n* Chavan Hospital\n\n* Reghu Leela Shopping Mall\n* Infinity 2 Mall\n* Sunrays Shopping Center\n* V Mall\n\n* Hari Om Khaman House\n* WTC Pasta\n* Deepalis Only Veg\n* The Shawarma Fellow\n\n![Shreeji Sharan Group](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/713_1678040177_shreeji-logo.webp)\n\n## [Shreeji Sharan Group](/mumbai/sale/builder/shreeji-sharan-group-713)\n\nOngoing Projects: 12\n\nCompleted Projects: 8\n\nTotal Projects: 20\n\n---\n\nShreeji Sharan Developers is a well-established real estate company based in Mumbai, founded in the year 2015. They have a reputation for constructing high-quality residential and commercial properties, focusing on providing comfortable and modern living spaces. Some of their notable projects include \"Shreeji Heights\" and \"Shreeji Plaza,\" both located in prime locations in the city.   \n  \nThey are currently working on several new projects, including \"Shreeji Elite\" and \"Shreeji Heights II,\" which are set to raise the bar for luxury living in Mumbai. Their commitment to customer satisfaction and timely delivery of projects has earned them a loyal clientele.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Shreeji Sharan Group](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/shreeji-sharan-group-713)\n\n## About Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n**Shreeji Skyrise** is a **luxury under-construction skyscraper on S.V. Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai**, developed by Shreeji Sharan Group. Rising **56–58 storeys**, with the first habitable floor starting **130 ft. above ground**, it offers **2 & 3 BHK residences with private decks** and panoramic views of the **Sanjay Gandhi National Park** and the sea. The tower features **204 exclusive units**, launched in **December 2021**, with possession expected by **December 2026**.\n\nThe project offers thoughtfully planned homes with **RERA carpet areas** — **2BHK: 715–827 sq. ft.** and **3BHK: 1071–1102 sq. ft.** — designed for spacious urban living. Residents enjoy **30+ lifestyle amenities**, including a **swimming pool, gymnasium, jogging track**, and **10 levels of ramp car parking**, creating a well-rounded high-rise living experience.\n\nStrategically located in Kandivali West, the development is close to prominent landmarks such as **Shree Kala Hanuman Temple**, **Shri Swami Narayan Temple**, **Country Club**, **Poisar Gymkhana**, and healthcare facilities like **ACE Heart Hospital** and **Namaha Hospital**. With reputed educational institutions including **Thakur International School** and **Shri T P Bhatia College** nearby, the project combines **connectivity, convenience, and premium lifestyle living** in one of Mumbai’s sought-after western suburbs.\n\n## **Who This Project Is Best Suited For**\n\n**Generally suited for:**\n\n* Working professionals commuting within Western suburbs\n* Small to mid-sized families planning long-term residence\n* Buyers upgrading from older cooperative buildings\n* Homebuyers who value usability over decorative luxury\n\n**May not be ideal for:**\n\n* Buyers looking for independent villas\n* Those seeking ultra-low-density boutique projects\n* Short-term speculative investors\n\nThis clarity helps buyers filter their choices realistically before scheduling site visits.\n\n## **Daily Living Experience Around the Project**\n\nDaily life in Kandivali West typically balances residential calm with city accessibility. The area supports routine activities such as commuting, grocery access, school schedules, and healthcare visits without excessive daily travel.\n\nCompared to several [homes in Mumbai localities](https://houssed.com/location-review/mumbai) that experience high rental turnover, this neighbourhood largely attracts long-term residents. That stability often creates a predictable and comfortable environment preferred by families.\n\n## **Configuration Planning & Space Usability**\n\nThe layouts at Shreeji Skyrise are designed for everyday practicality rather than brochure-focused aesthetics. After furnishing, room proportions, window placement, and circulation paths directly impact comfort.\n\n**Key usability aspects include:**\n\n* Clearly defined living and dining areas\n* Bedrooms positioned for privacy\n* Efficient furniture placement options\n* Minimal internal space wastage\n\nFor buyers evaluating [2BHK homes for sale in Mumbai](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/flats/2bhk), the configurations aim to balance shared family areas with personal comfort, making them suitable for long-term use.\n\n## **Project Status & Possession Clarity**\n\nUnderstanding the project’s current stage is essential before making a decision. When construction progresses steadily, buyers can better assess finishing standards and surroundings.\n\n| Aspect | Why It Matters |\n| --- | --- |\n| Construction stage | Shows what is physically complete |\n| Site readiness | Sets realistic expectations |\n| Possession clarity | Enables structured move-in planning |\n\nIf the project falls under [Ready To Move Projects in Mumbai for sale](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move), it offers additional certainty for buyers planning immediate occupancy.\n\n## **Long-Term Comfort & Society Living**\n\nLong-term satisfaction depends on how the residential society functions after possession. Maintenance quality, density planning, and resident composition all influence daily experience.\n\nProjects with balanced tower planning and organised common spaces are generally easier to manage over time. For families intending to stay several years, this practical aspect often matters more than initial presentation.\n\n## **Cost of Living (Beyond the Price)**\n\nWhen budgeting for **Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West, Mumbai**, buyers should account for recurring expenses beyond the purchase value.\n\n**Typical ongoing costs may include:**\n\n* Monthly society maintenance\n* Electricity and water consumption\n* Parking-related charges\n* Periodic repair or upkeep\n\nModern residential projects usually offer structured maintenance systems, which makes long-term financial planning more predictable.\n\n## **Compared to Older Residential Buildings Nearby**\n\nBuyers often compare new developments with resale properties in the same micro-market. Differences become clearer after multiple visits.\n\n| Aspect | Shreeji Skyrise | Older Buildings |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Structural condition | New construction | Age-related wear |\n| Layout planning | Modern & efficient | Often outdated |\n| Maintenance systems | Organised | Varies widely |\n| Lift & parking planning | Pre-planned | Limited in many cases |\n\nFor those exploring [new residential projects in Mumbai](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/flats/possession/new-projects), newer developments generally involve fewer uncertainties related to structural repairs and system upgrades.\n\n## **Safety, Privacy & Family Comfort**\n\nSafety and privacy are key considerations when buying residential property in Mumbai.\n\nIn a gated residential environment:\n\n* Entry and exit movement is structured\n* Common areas are clearly separated\n* Residential spaces are shielded from heavy commercial activity\n\nThis contributes to a calmer, more secure setting suitable for family living.\n\n## **Final Perspective**\n\nChoosing Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West, Mumbai is less about comparing feature lists and more about evaluating lifestyle compatibility. Buyers who prioritise practical layouts, structured society systems, and the convenience of an established suburban setting often find it aligned with long-term residential comfort.\n\n## FAQ's about Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Resale flats in Shreeji Skyrise\n\n [View all 2 properties](/buy/residential/resale/mumbai/shreeji-skyrise-1184)\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Apartments in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n\n### Explore Projects in Kandivali West\n\n* [New Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Pre Launch Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/possession/pre-launch)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by BHK in Kandivali West\n\n* [1BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/1bhk)\n* [2BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/2bhk)\n* [3BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/3bhk)\n* [4+ BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/4-plus-bhk)\n* [4BHK Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/4bhk)\n\n### Homes by Budget in Kandivali West\n\n* [Homes in Kandivali West Above 5 Cr](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/budget/above-5-cr)\n* [Homes in Kandivali 