oject ›](/ad-click/900040)\n\n## 📰 Latest Mumbai Property News\n\n[View all news →](/news)\n\n[![Dhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8ab151e7dd57.png)\n\nArticles\n\nDhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![BMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/a5490eaafe8c.png)\n\nArticles\n\nBMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001930/bmc-begins-fresh-sea-level-risk-assessment-for-mumbai)[![MahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/499075ce4cdd.png)\n\nArticles\n\nMahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001927/maharera-orders-l-t-to-fix-defects-at-crescent-bay-parel)[![GIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8d8e7c8b42a9.png)\n\nArticles\n\nGIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra\n\n📅 05 Sep 2026](/news/2001922/gis-maps-to-be-attached-to-sale-deeds-from-october-in-maharashtra)","images":[]},{"url":"https://divyahousingagency.com/property/skyrise-2","title":"Shreeji Skyrise 3 BHK in S V Road, Kandivali West","raw_content":"![Divya Housing Agency — Property Consultants Malad West Mumbai](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/themes/divya-housing-premium/assets/images/logo.webp)\n![Divya Housing Agency](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/themes/divya-housing-premium/assets/images/logo.webp)\n![Shreeji Skyrise 3 BHK 1038 SqFt Flat in S V Road, Kandivali West — Photo 1](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Skyrise-1.jpe)\n![]()\n\n# Shreeji Skyrise 3 BHK 1038 SqFt Flat in S V Road, Kandivali West\n\n[S V Road, Kandivali West](https://divyahousingagency.com/area/kandivali-west/)  — Shreeji Skyrise, Swami Vivekanand Rd, opp. Fire Station, Kandivali, Parekh Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n## Project Information\n\n## Codename Skyrise\n\n#### 3BHK | Residential Apartment | In Kandivali West | On Sale |\n\n**Codename Skyrise** Is Strategically Located at Kandivali West Mumbai. Skyrise Offering **3BHK Premium Residences Apartment 3BHK 1038/1086-Deck Carpet and 60 Storey Tower**. It Also Offers Exclusive Amenities. **Codename Skyrise** Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar is a RERA-registered project with registration number **P51800032149.**\n\n**Codename Skyrise by Shreeji Sharan Group** is a newly launched project in the Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar, offering spacious apartments for a mid-range budget. This affordable luxury project brings you apartments in Kandivali (West), which are scheduled for possession in Dec 2026. Codename Skyrise Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar is a RERA-registered project with registration number P51800032149. Codename Skyrise Kandivali (West) has a single tower, with 51 floors each and 189 units to offer. This project is spread over an area of 1.38 acres. With all the basic amenities available, Codename Skyrise offers comfort and a reasonably priced lifestyle.\n\nSituated at a prime location in Kandivali East, Skyrise is a meticulously designed project of Mumbai. The project offers Under Construction units. Skyrise has been developed by the well-known builder Shreeji Sharan Group of Companies. 400101 is the area pin code under which this project falls. Enjoy the luxury of living with all modern conveniences in Skyrise.\n\n#### **Available**\n\n##### 3BHK | Residential Apartment | Flat In Kandivali West | On Sale |\n\n#### Amenities\n\n## Amenities & Features\n\n## Location & Nearby Connectivity\n\n## About Kandivali West\n\nKandivali West is a well-connected western suburb location with residential options across ready, resale and new-launch properties. Buyers usually compare projects here by carpet area, possession stage, connectivity, amenities and budget.For current availability in this neighbourhood, speak with Divya Housing Agency and compare verified options before booking a visit.\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions — Shreeji Skyrise\n\nVisible feedback shown for trust; no self-serving review schema is generated.\n\nFound our 2 BHK in Malad West within our budget in just 3 site visits. The team knew exactly which pockets to show us.\n\nOne call to Divya Housing and we had 4 genuine options the same week. No time wasting, no fake listings. Closed in 3 weeks.\n\nTransparent brokerage no surprises at the end. Handled all paperwork and legal verification.\n\n## Similar Properties You May Like\n\n![73 East — 2 BHK, 3 BHK in Kandivali West](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/73East-1.jpe)\n\n## [73 East](https://divyahousingagency.com/project/73-east/)\n\n![House Of Hiranandani — 2 BHK, 3 BHK in Kandivali West](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/House-Of-Hiranandani.jpe)\n\n## [House Of Hiranandani](https://divyahousingagency.com/project/house-of-hiranandani/)\n\n![Siddha Seabrook — 2 BHK, 3 BHK in Kandivali West](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Siddha-Seabrook.jpg)\n\n## [Siddha Seabrook](https://divyahousingagency.com/project/siddha-seabrook/)\n\n3 BHK | Carpet 1038 SqFt\n\n### Get Property Details\n\nWe will confirm the exact appointment after checking current access and availability.\n\n![Divya Housing Agency](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/themes/divya-housing-premium/assets/images/logo.webp)\n\nTrusted RERA-registered real estate consultants in Malad West, Mumbai. Specialising in residential and commercial properties across Mumbai's western suburbs since 2004.\n\n### Buy a Flat\n\n### Browse by Location\n\n### About Us\n\n© 2026 Divya Housing Agency. All rights reserved.\n\nWe will confirm the exact appointment after checking current access and availability.\n\nWe will confirm the exact appointment after checking current access and availability.\n\n## WhatsApp Enquiry\n\nShare your details and continue to WhatsApp.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertypistol.com/projects/shreeji-skyrise-kandivali-west-pid-13110","title":"Shreeji Skyrise in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price, Brochure, Floor Plan, Location","raw_content":"1. [Home](/)\n2. /\n3. [Mumbai](/mumbai)\n4. /\n5. [Flats for sale in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n6. /\n7. [New Projects in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n8. /\n9. [New Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai/buy/real-estate-projects-in-kandivali-west)\n10. /\n11. Shreeji Skyrise\n\n# Shreeji Skyrise\n\nFlats by **[Shreeji Sharan Group of Companies](/mumbai/buy/projects-by-shreeji-sharan-group-of-companies)** at Shreeji Skyrise | Apartments In Kandivali West, Swami Vivekananda Road, opp. Fire Station, Kandivali, Parekh Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nRERA\n\nP51800032149\n\nAgent RERA - A51700000043\n\nINR2.69 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nINR2.69 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nConfigurations2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nPossession DateDec 2026\n\nBuilt up AreaOn request\n\nCarpet Area715 - 1,102\n\n* Sq.ft\n* Sq.yrd\n* Sq.mtr\n* Acres\n\nMin. Price per Sqft.INR 37.62 K per Sqft.\n\n<https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\nP51800032149\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/shreeji-skyrise-project-kandivali-west-mumbai/890","title":"Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West | Latest Price, Floor Plans & Brochure","raw_content":"All Categories\n\n* All Categories\n* Shops\n* Hotels\n* Restaurants\n* Bars\n* Events\n* Fitness\n\n\n\n1. [Home](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n2. [Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n3. [Western Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-western-mumbai-mumbai)\n4. [Kandivali West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-kandivali-west-mumbai)\n5. Shreeji Skyrise\n\n## About Shreeji Skyrise\n\n### Overview\n\nProject Area\n\nNo. of Storey's\n\nParking Type\n\n0.75 Acres\n\n58 Storeys\n\nPossession Date\n\nPossession Status\n\nProject Rera No.\n\nDecember 2026\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\n### **Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West – Project Overview**\n\nShreeji Skyrise is a premium high-rise residential project by Shreeji Sharan Group, located in Kandivali West, Mumbai. Designed for modern urban living, the project offers spacious and well-planned apartments with panoramic city views. With its impressive height and contemporary architecture, Shreeji Skyrise stands out as a landmark residential development in the western suburbs of Mumbai.\n\nThe project combines comfort, connectivity, and lifestyle convenience, making it an ideal choice for families and professionals seeking quality homes in Kandivali West.\n\n### **Apartment Configuration & Carpet Area**\n\nShreeji Skyrise offers thoughtfully designed apartments with efficient layouts:\n\n* Configuration: 2 BHK & 3 BHK Apartments\n* Carpet Area: 715 sq. ft. to 1102 sq. ft.\n* Smart floor plans with ample natural light and ventilation\n\nThese homes are suitable for buyers looking for premium apartments in Kandivali West Mumbai.\n\n### **Project Area & Building Details**\n\n* Total Project Area: 0.75 Acres\n* Number of Storeys: 58 Storeys\n* Parking Type: Covered Parking\n\nThe tall tower design ensures unobstructed views and a modern high-rise living experience.\n\n### **RERA Registration & Possession Details**\n\n* RERA Registration Number: P51800032149\n* Project Status: Under Construction\n* Possession Date: December 2026\n\nRERA registration ensures transparency, compliance, and buyer confidence.\n\n### **Location Advantages of Shreeji Skyrise Kandivali West**\n\nShreeji Skyrise enjoys a strategic location in Kandivali West, offering excellent connectivity to:\n\n* Link Road and SV Road\n* Metro stations and railway connectivity\n* Schools, colleges, hospitals, and shopping malls\n* Commercial hubs and business districts\n\nThe well-developed neighborhood ensures daily convenience and strong long-term demand.\n\n### **Price Range & Investment Potential**\n\nThe Shreeji Skyrise price is competitive considering its high-rise structure, premium apartment sizes, and prime Kandivali West location. With growing infrastructure and consistent demand in the western suburbs, the project offers strong potential for capital appreciation and rental returns.\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nShreeji Skyrise brochure\n\n## Pricing of Shreeji Skyrise\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [2 BHK Apartment](#tabs-5)\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n\n* [715 sqft](#tabs-3284)\n* [781 sqft](#tabs-3285)\n* [811 sqft](#tabs-3286)\n* [827 sqft](#tabs-3287)\n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 715 sqft | Price:  ₹ 2.69 Cr\n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 781 sqft | Price:  ₹ 2.93 Cr\n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 811 sqft | Price:  ₹ 3.05 Cr\n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 827 sqft | Price:  ₹ 3.11 Cr\n\n* [1071 sqft](#tabs-3288)\n* [1102 sqft](#tabs-3289)\n* [1038 sqft](#tabs-10911)\n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1071 sqft | Price:  ₹ 4.02 Cr\n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1102 sqft | Price:  ₹ 4.14 Cr\n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1038 sqft | Price:  ₹ 3.90 Cr\n\n## Property Features of Shreeji Skyrise\n\n### Amenities\n\n* Banquet Hall\n\n* Cafeteria\n\n* Club house\n\n* Jogging Track\n\n* Sports Courts\n\n* Kids Play Area\n\n* Swimming Pool\n\n* Jacuzzi\n\n* Yoga Zone\n\n* Fitness Corner\n\n* Gym\n\n* Party Lawn\n\n* Amphitheater\n\n* Mini-Theater\n\n* Library\n\n* Open Gym\n\n* Reflexology\n\n---\n\n### Facilities\n\n* Intercom\n\n* Modular Kitchen\n\n* Air Conditioned\n\n* Internet / WiFi\n\n* Lift\n\n* Gas Pipeline\n\n* Power Back Up\n\n* Parking\n\n* Security System\n\n* Washroom\n\n* 24\\*7 Water\n\n* No open drainage